PaymentRails_PreviewExecutionNative
├── when the native key is not configured
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_NoActionConfigured
├── given native balance is zero
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_ZeroAmount
├── given native balance is below minBalance
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_BelowMinimumBalance
├── when module validation fails
│   └── it should revert with the module reason
└── given a native route with sufficient balance
    ├── it should return the native balance as estimatedOutput
    └── it should return the module output token
